18
00:08:48.153 --> 00:08:50.196
Papa-oom-mow-mow.
You have to ask Steve.
He's game master.

19
00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:52.031
He has absolute power.

20
00:08:52.115 --> 00:08:54.992
